1
00:00:06,07 --> 00:00:10,03
Slow down! The paper won't be sold out at 1:00 in the morning.
你慢一點，報紙不會在 半夜一點就全部賣光的

2
00:00:10,24 --> 00:00:12,83
I'm excited! I've never been reviewed before!
我好興奮 第一次有我的劇評

3
00:00:13,04 --> 00:00:16,60
You were so amazing as the king! I'm really impressed.
你演國王演得太精采了 我真的好欣賞，真的

4
00:00:16,85 --> 00:00:18,07
But you know what?
不過你知道嗎？

5
00:00:18,28 --> 00:00:20,77
You might wanna wear underwear next time.
我覺得下一次啊 你應該考慮要穿穿內褲

6
00:00:21,35 --> 00:00:24,72
When you sat on the throne, you could see your...
因為當你登上寶座的時候 觀眾可以看到你的…

7
00:00:24,95 --> 00:00:26,55
... royal subjects.
…龍根子

8
00:00:27,76 --> 00:00:29,45
Here it is! Here it is!
有了，在這兒

9
00:00:30,06 --> 00:00:33,62
"The only thing worse than the mindless adolescent direction...
唯一比沒大腦又孩子氣的 導演還要爛的是…

10
00:00:33,86 --> 00:00:38,70
...was Joseph Tribbiani's disturbingly unskilled portrayal of the king."
…崔喬伊對國王的 超級遜栓釋

11
00:00:39,13 --> 00:00:41,36
Okay,look. That is one guy's opinion.
那只是一個人的意見

12
00:00:41,60 --> 00:00:44,23
All right? Pheebs,read yours.
菲碧，念你的

13
00:00:44,44 --> 00:00:48,07
"The only thing worse than the mindless,adolescent direction"
「唯一比沒大腦又孩子氣的導演 還要爛的是…」

14
00:00:48,28 --> 00:00:50,30
Anybody have a different paper?
誰念一念別家報紙可以嗎？

15
00:00:51,91 --> 00:00:53,11
Ross,read yours.
羅斯，念你的

16
00:00:53,75 --> 00:00:55,15
I don't want to.
我不想念

17
00:00:56,75 --> 00:01:00,12
Joey,they don't know what they're talking about.
喬伊，蜜糖 他們不知道他們在講什麼

18
00:01:00,62 --> 00:01:01,61
Maybe they do.
那不一定

19
00:01:01,89 --> 00:01:05,99
I've done this 10 years and I'm nowhere. There's gotta be a reason.
演了十年還混不出名堂 不是因為我爛是什麼

20
00:01:06,23 --> 00:01:08,56
Come on,you're just paying your dues.
別這樣嘛，你現在是耕耘階段

21
00:01:08,76 --> 00:01:10,86
No,no,no. It's too hard.
不…太難了

22
00:01:11,07 --> 00:01:13,00
It's not worth it. I quit.
這不值得，我不幹了

23
00:01:13,23 --> 00:01:14,46
Come on,Joey!
別這樣…

24
00:01:14,67 --> 00:01:17,07
Wait,wait one minute. Wait a minute.
等一下…

25
00:01:17,31 --> 00:01:20,00
I believe this will change your mind.
包你聽了會回心轉意的

26
00:01:20,24 --> 00:01:24,94
"ln a mediocre play,Joseph Tribbiani achieved brilliant levels of
在這出平凡的戲裡崔喬伊 成功地躍上另一美妙新境界…

27
00:01:25,25 --> 00:01:27,31
Continued on page 153.
接153頁

28
00:01:28,12 --> 00:01:29,31
sucking."
…超級爛

29
00:01:30,79 --> 00:01:32,78
The One With Russ
<font color=#38B0DE>-=BT之家DRM小組 http://bbs.btbbt.com=- 河馬壓縮製作 本字幕為河馬根據R3DVD OCR得來</font>

30
00:01:38,92 --> 00:01:45,82
六人行 第2季 第10集 納斯（羅斯翻版）

31
00:02:16,40 --> 00:02:18,39
I used to want to be a vet.
小時候，我的志願是當獸醫

32
00:02:18,60 --> 00:02:22,04
Then I found out you have to put your hands into cows.
然後我發現我必須要把手 伸到牛的什麼的裡面

33
00:02:27,38 --> 00:02:28,36
Are you okay?
你好嗎？

34
00:02:28,61 --> 00:02:31,27
Just a tough day at work,you know?
很好，只是水深火熱的一天

35
00:02:31,51 --> 00:02:33,74
Stegosaurus fell over,trapped a kid.
劍龍倒了，困住一個小孩

36
00:02:36,68 --> 00:02:39,41
I know this jacket. This is Fun Bobby's jacket!
我認得這件夾克 這是風趣巴比的夾克

37
00:02:39,62 --> 00:02:41,75
Where is he? He's here,isn't he?
他在哪裡？他在，對不對？

38
00:02:42,02 --> 00:02:43,75
-Maybe. -Don't toy with me.
或許 別耍我

39
00:02:44,26 --> 00:02:45,09
Geller!
老蓋勒

40
00:02:45,29 --> 00:02:46,92
Hey,Fun Bobby!
風趣巴比

41
00:02:47,20 --> 00:02:49,03
Hey! You been working out?
你有去健身啊？

42
00:02:49,26 --> 00:02:50,25
Not at all.
才沒有呢

43
00:02:50,47 --> 00:02:51,96
I love this guy!
我愛這傢伙

44
00:02:53,43 --> 00:02:55,80
I'm psyched to hear you're back with Monica.
好高興聽到 你又跟我妹妹在一起了

45
00:02:56,04 --> 00:02:58,13
-You and me both! -So what'd I miss?
我們都是 我錯過了什麼嗎？

46
00:02:58,37 --> 00:03:00,74
We were trying to make Joey feel better.
我們只是讓喬伊覺得好過一點

47
00:03:01,44 --> 00:03:02,74
Need me to pick you up?
需要我把你舉起來嗎？

48
00:03:03,24 --> 00:03:04,73
No,I'm all right,man.
不，我沒事了，真的

49
00:03:04,95 --> 00:03:06,28
No,I'm picking you up!
不，我要把你舉起來

50
00:03:06,55 --> 00:03:08,78
No,seriously. I don't need you to
不，真的，我不需要…

51
00:03:11,49 --> 00:03:12,78
It still works!
好吧，還是有用

52
00:03:13,05 --> 00:03:16,15
Before I go,does anybody else need to be picked up?
在我走之前 有誰還要被我給舉起來的？

53
00:03:17,56 --> 00:03:18,96
I'm still gonna go.
我還是走好了

54
00:03:19,89 --> 00:03:21,23
See you later,babe.
待會兒見了，拜拜

55
00:03:23,33 --> 00:03:27,13
Public display of affection coming up. You can avert your eyes.
我們要公開親熱 大家的眼睛請迴避一下

56
00:03:34,48 --> 00:03:35,34
See you.
再見…

57
00:03:36,98 --> 00:03:38,57
Fun Bobby is so great.
這個風趣巴比好棒

58
00:03:38,78 --> 00:03:39,91
Oh,isn't he?
可不是嘛

59
00:03:40,15 --> 00:03:44,81
I think this time it may work with him. He makes me feel so good.
我認為這一回我們會定下來 他讓我覺得好棒

60
00:03:45,02 --> 00:03:48,35
I've been feeling so lousy lately. No job,no boyfriend.
過去兩個月我一直覺得好郁卒 沒有工作，沒有男友

61
00:03:48,59 --> 00:03:50,85
Well,at least my cup is half full.
至少現在我有一樣了

62
00:03:51,59 --> 00:03:53,65
Half full of love!
有一樣「愛…」

63
00:03:56,20 --> 00:03:59,93
For our two-week anniversary, he's taking me to his cousin's cabin.
他為了慶祝我們的雙周慶 週末要帶我去他表哥的小木屋

64
00:04:00,17 --> 00:04:02,14
Cabin of love!
「愛…的小屋」

65
00:04:04,27 --> 00:04:06,54
We went through a lot of wine tonight.
我們今晚喝了好多酒

66
00:04:06,81 --> 00:04:08,04
I only had two glasses.
真的？我才喝了兩杯

67
00:04:08,28 --> 00:04:09,27
I had a glass.
我只喝了一杯

68
00:04:09,51 --> 00:04:10,37
Two.
兩杯

69
00:04:10,61 --> 00:04:11,48
I had one glass.
我喝了一杯

70
00:04:11,68 --> 00:04:13,04
I had a mug full in this...
我用這可愛的…

71
00:04:13,31 --> 00:04:16,34
... I-got-boned-at-the- Museum-of-Natural-History mug.
…「我在自然歷史 博物館看到骨頭了」喝了一杯

72
00:04:18,29 --> 00:04:20,78
Okay,so that's what? Two bottles.
這麼說的話，頂多兩瓶

73
00:04:21,02 --> 00:04:23,46
And yet somehow we went through five?
可是這裡有五個瓶子

74
00:04:36,20 --> 00:04:39,37
So what? So he drank a lot tonight.
那又怎麼樣，他今晚喝多了

75
00:04:39,81 --> 00:04:42,24
Now that I think about it, I don't think...
是呀，不過現在我想起來…

76
00:04:42,51 --> 00:04:45,31
...I've ever seen Fun Bobby without a drink.
我記得風趣巴比酒不離手

77
00:04:47,05 --> 00:04:50,71
And did you notice how he always starts his stories with...
你們有沒有注意過 他故事的開頭總是…

78
00:04:50,92 --> 00:04:55,65
... "Okay,I was so wasted!" or "Oh,we were so bombed!"
「我喝得爛醉了」 或者是「我們好醉了」

79
00:04:55,86 --> 00:04:58,83
"So I wake up and I'm in this dumpster in Connecticut!"
或者是「我醒來以後發現 我在康州一輛清道車裡面」

80
00:05:01,00 --> 00:05:03,73
Have you been with him when he wasn't drinking?
摩妮卡，你們約會時 他有沒有喝過酒？

81
00:05:03,93 --> 00:05:07,66
We just happen to go to a lot of places where you might drink.
只是恰巧而已 我們去的地方都會喝酒的

82
00:05:07,87 --> 00:05:11,07
How do you go to a wine-tasting without having a drink?
我是說去品酒會 怎麼可能不來杯酒的

83
00:05:11,51 --> 00:05:13,91
Or to a club,or to the...
或者是去俱樂部或是去…

84
00:05:14,24 --> 00:05:15,44
...zoo.
…動物園

85
00:05:17,55 --> 00:05:19,60
中央公園

86
00:05:20,38 --> 00:05:22,44
Rach,does this have nonfat milk?
瑞秋，裡面有沒有脫脂奶？

87
00:05:23,25 --> 00:05:25,28
I don't know,taste it.
不知道，你試試看吧

88
00:05:29,22 --> 00:05:31,09
Too late,you already had some.
來不及，抱歉，你喝過了

89
00:05:34,56 --> 00:05:37,79
What do you say we make these coffees lrish?
我們把這都弄成了愛爾蘭咖啡 你們認為怎麼樣？

90
00:05:41,54 --> 00:05:42,56
Cake!
蛋糕！

91
00:05:43,94 --> 00:05:46,53
Yeah,we're gonna get some cake.
對，我們去拿蛋糕

92
00:05:49,04 --> 00:05:53,10
It seems like you've been making an awful lot of stuff "lrish" lately.
我發現你最近好像把很多東西 都弄成愛爾蘭式的

93
00:05:53,38 --> 00:05:57,72
I'd make them Belgian,but the waffles are hard to get into that flask.
我很想弄成比利時式的 可是餅乾很難塞進酒瓶子裡

94
00:05:59,79 --> 00:06:00,81
Yeah,okay.
好吧

95
00:06:01,66 --> 00:06:05,82
Maybe it's none of my business. Or maybe it is,I don't know.
聽著，這或許不關我的事 或許有關，我不知道

96
00:06:06,76 --> 00:06:07,99
I'm worried about you.
我有點擔心你

97
00:06:09,06 --> 00:06:13,47
This isn't the first time somebody said something to me about this.
這不是第一次 有人跟我說過這件事情了

98
00:06:13,67 --> 00:06:17,33
But I always made excuses, like "I'm just a social drinker."
我老是為我自己找一些藉口 像「跟朋友在一起才喝」

99
00:06:17,61 --> 00:06:20,07
Or "Come on,it's Flag Day!"
或「來嘛，今天是國慶日」

100
00:06:22,18 --> 00:06:23,97
So,what are you saying now?
那你現在怎麼說呢？

101
00:06:25,51 --> 00:06:27,34
I guess I'm saying...
我猜我要說…

102
00:06:27,62 --> 00:06:28,98
... I'll try and quit.
…我戒戒看

103
00:06:29,58 --> 00:06:31,35
I like that you worry about me.
我喜歡你擔心我的樣子

104
00:06:35,02 --> 00:06:36,99
So,what's going on?
發生什麼事了？

105
00:06:37,43 --> 00:06:39,59
I am gonna try and quit drinking.
我要試著戒酒了

106
00:06:39,79 --> 00:06:41,32
Oh! Why?
為什麼？

107
00:06:48,47 --> 00:06:49,94
Guess who's back in show biz!
猜誰又回演藝圈了？

108
00:06:51,34 --> 00:06:52,31
Lorne Greene?
羅倫格林

109
00:06:55,04 --> 00:06:57,14
No. You know why? Because he's dead.
不是，菲比 你知道為什麼嗎？他死了

110
00:06:57,38 --> 00:06:58,64
Oh,no.
天啊

111
00:07:00,72 --> 00:07:03,01
This is gonna seem bittersweet now...
我猜這似乎有點苦樂參半…

112
00:07:03,22 --> 00:07:05,28
... but Joey,that's who!
是喬伊老弟耶

113
00:07:06,72 --> 00:07:09,62
My agent called with an audition for Days Of Our Lives!
是啊，我經紀人叫我去 「我們的日子」試鏡看看

114
00:07:10,39 --> 00:07:11,22
Kick ass!
帥啊

115
00:07:12,63 --> 00:07:16,03
We have to celebrate! We should do a soap opera theme.
那我們必須要慶祝 應該開個肥皂劇主題派對

116
00:07:16,30 --> 00:07:19,70
We could all sleep together, then one of us could get amnesia!
對，我們可以一起上床 然後其中一個人失去記憶

117
00:07:23,91 --> 00:07:26,64
When do you get off? We'll do something tonight.
阿秋，你什麼時候下班？ 晚上一起做點什麼

118
00:07:27,48 --> 00:07:31,21
Well,actually,I'm already done. But I kind of got plans.
事實上，我下班了 但我有其他計劃耶

119
00:07:32,35 --> 00:07:33,87
You have other friends?
你有別的朋友

120
00:07:36,38 --> 00:07:37,87
I have a date.
對，我…我有約會

121
00:07:38,09 --> 00:07:38,92
What?
什麼？

122
00:07:39,15 --> 00:07:40,09
With a man?
跟男人？

123
00:07:41,49 --> 00:07:43,72
What's so strange about me having a date?
怎麼？ 我有約會有什麼奇怪的？

124
00:07:43,93 --> 00:07:45,15
What about Ross?
那羅斯怎麼辦？

125
00:07:45,36 --> 00:07:47,85
You're still mad because he made that list?
你還在為列單子的事 在跟他生氣，是不是？

126
00:07:48,06 --> 00:07:50,50
No,no,I'm not mad at him.
不…我不生氣了

127
00:07:50,70 --> 00:07:53,26
I'm not really "anything" at him anymore.
我對他再也不怎麼了

128
00:07:53,57 --> 00:07:56,00
-What are you talking about? -I don't know.
你在胡說些什麼？ 我不知道

129
00:07:57,51 --> 00:08:00,17
Whatever I was feeling,I'm...
不管我從前怎麼樣，我…

130
00:08:00,41 --> 00:08:01,24
... not.
…不了

131
00:08:01,44 --> 00:08:03,10
But you guys came so close.
你們就差一點點��

132
00:08:03,34 --> 00:08:06,37
I'm sorry. You'll have to get used to the fact...
我知道，對不起啦，各位 你們只得習慣…

133
00:08:06,58 --> 00:08:08,67
...that I will not be dating Ross.
…我不會跟羅斯約會這個事實

134
00:08:10,69 --> 00:08:11,78
Here he is.
他來了

135
00:08:13,35 --> 00:08:15,62
Guys,this is Russ.
各位，這是洛斯

136
00:08:28,70 --> 00:08:31,93
I'm not saying you're not talented. You're very talented.
不…我不是說你沒才華 你非常有才華

137
00:08:32,17 --> 00:08:36,11
But with the bird dead and all, there's very little act left.
只是那隻鳥死了之後 剩下的戲就很少了

138
00:08:36,68 --> 00:08:38,98
Honey,give me a break,will you?
蜜糖，放我一馬，好嗎？

139
00:08:39,18 --> 00:08:40,55
I'll talk to you later.
我等會兒再打給你

140
00:08:40,75 --> 00:08:42,58
There's my favorite client!
我最喜愛的客戶來了

141
00:08:42,85 --> 00:08:45,41
So tell me,darling, how was the audition?
告訴我，親愛的 試鏡結果如何？

142
00:08:45,69 --> 00:08:49,62
I think it went well. I got a callback for Thursday.
我覺得進行得滿順利的 他們要我週四複試

143
00:08:49,86 --> 00:08:52,92
Joey! Have you ever seen me ecstatic?
喬伊，你見過我心醉神迷嗎？

144
00:08:54,36 --> 00:08:55,92
Well,here it is.
那你見識看看

145
00:09:00,23 --> 00:09:04,10
Okay! Listen,there's something I want to talk to you about.
對了，有件事我想跟你談談

146
00:09:04,31 --> 00:09:05,40
The casting lady
電視台的選角小姐…

147
00:09:05,61 --> 00:09:07,63
Oh,isn't Lori a doll?
羅莉是不是很棒？

148
00:09:07,91 --> 00:09:08,81
She's great.
對…她很棒

149
00:09:10,58 --> 00:09:14,95
But I kind of got the feeling that she was sort of coming on to me.
可是…我有點覺得 她好像對我有那麼一點點意思

150
00:09:15,22 --> 00:09:19,55
And I definitely would get the part if I were to,you know....
我覺得如果我想得到 那個角色的話，就要…

151
00:09:23,76 --> 00:09:26,39
If I sent the little general in.
派我的「小將軍」出馬

152
00:09:28,80 --> 00:09:32,60
I see! Well,I'm just gonna put in a call here...
我懂了 我現在就打個電話…

153
00:09:32,80 --> 00:09:36,43
...and we'll find out what's going on and straighten it out.
…把事情搞清楚 看看究竟是怎麼回事

154
00:09:37,47 --> 00:09:38,94
Lori,please.
你好啊，請接羅莉

155
00:09:41,08 --> 00:09:42,84
Hi,darling!
親愛的

156
00:09:43,14 --> 00:09:46,11
How about Joey Tribbiani for the part of the cab driver?
崔喬伊適不適合 計程車司機那個角色？

157
00:09:46,31 --> 00:09:48,08
Isn't he terrific?
他是不是棒透了？

158
00:09:52,62 --> 00:09:54,52
Okay,doll,talk to you later.
我們等會兒再談

159
00:09:55,09 --> 00:09:57,18
You're gonna have to sleep with her.
對，你必須跟她上床

160
00:10:01,26 --> 00:10:03,09
-What's the matter? -Fun Bobby.
你怎麼了？ 是風趣巴比

161
00:10:03,30 --> 00:10:04,63
What? Isn't he sober?
怎麼？他又喝酒了？

162
00:10:04,83 --> 00:10:06,27
Oh,he's sober all right.
他是沒喝酒

163
00:10:06,50 --> 00:10:09,20
Turns out that Fun Bobby was fun for a reason.
只是我發現 風趣巴比風趣是有原因的

164
00:10:14,18 --> 00:10:16,44
All right,here you go,sweetie.
拿去吧，甜心

165
00:10:17,28 --> 00:10:19,80
Thanks. You wanna hear something funny?
謝了 要不要聽一個有趣的故事？

166
00:10:20,05 --> 00:10:21,64
Oh,God,yes!
好啊，要

167
