There are no hardware stores open past midnight in the Village.
只要一過了午夜 這附近的五金行就全都關門了

168
00:10:30,69 --> 00:10:32,28
That is funny.
好好笑哦

169
00:10:33,39 --> 00:10:38,16
I needed to buy a hammer and I'm out walking around the neighborhood.
前幾天晚上我需要買一把鎯頭 我就出去在這附近逛了一逛

170
00:10:38,37 --> 00:10:39,56
But apparently...
但…

171
00:10:40,00 --> 00:10:44,73
...there are no hardware stores open past midnight in the Village.
這附近所有的五金行 一過了午夜之後都關門了

172
00:10:49,91 --> 00:10:52,07
Don't you have to be at your interview?
甜心，你不是該去面試了嗎？

173
00:10:52,38 --> 00:10:53,21
Oh,yeah.
是呀

174
00:10:56,58 --> 00:10:57,71
See you guys.
各位再見了

175
00:10:57,92 --> 00:10:58,82
