老天啊

178
00:11:04,73 --> 00:11:06,02
He's not that bad.
他還沒那麼糟啦

179
00:11:06,23 --> 00:11:10,19
Not that bad? Did you not hear the hammer story?
沒那麼糟？ 你沒有聽到那個故事嗎？

180
00:11:10,40 --> 00:11:12,56
Okay,don't get all squinky.
別那麼挑剔嘛

181
00:11:14,27 --> 00:11:17,07
Maybe it's the kind of story where you had to be there.
也許你應該身歷其境 才會覺得好笑啊

182
00:11:17,27 --> 00:11:18,67
But I'm gonna be there!
但我下半輩子…

183
00:11:18,87 --> 00:11:21,24
