瑞秋

195
00:12:00,31 --> 00:12:02,58
So,you know what you're doing,right?
你知道你在幹什麼嗎？

196
00:12:03,32 --> 00:12:04,48
Waitressing?
服務生？

197
00:12:04,72 --> 00:12:07,21
Well,yeah. But,no. I mean....
是又不是…

198
00:12:07,99 --> 00:12:10,96
Doesn't Russ just remind you of someone?
洛斯會不會 讓你想起某個人來呢？

199
00:12:12,89 --> 00:12:14,09
Bob Saget?
巴布西格？

200
00:12:14,66 --> 00:12:15,59
Oh,yeah!
對呀

201
00:12:16,90 --> 00:12:18,49
No,no,no!
不對…

202
00:12:19,67 --> 00:12:20,83
Oh,my,oh!
天呀

203
00:12:21,80 --> 00:12:22,63
What's wrong?
怎麼了？

204
00:12:24,51 --> 00:12:25,77
She's upset because...
她心情不好是因為…

205
00:12:25,97 --> 00:12:28,94
...she buttered a spider into her toast this morning.
…她不小心 把一隻蜘蛛塗在吐司上了

206
00:12:30,81 --> 00:12:31,97
All right.
好吧

207
00:12:34,25 --> 00:12:36,84
Listen,Pheebs. This is gonna be okay.
聽我說，菲菲，這不要緊的

208
00:12:37,35 --> 00:12:39,29
Ross,Russ. Russ,Ross.
羅斯，洛斯 洛斯，羅斯

209
00:12:43,42 --> 00:12:45,48
Are you a friend of Rachel's?
你是…瑞秋的朋友？

210
00:12:45,69 --> 00:12:46,75
Yes. Yes,I am.
是，我是

211
00:12:46,96 --> 00:12:49,59
Are you a friend of Rachel's?
你是…瑞秋的朋友嗎？

212
00:12:49,83 --> 00:12:52,70
Actually,I'm kind of a...
事實上，我是…

213
00:12:53,00 --> 00:12:54,09
...you know...
…可以說是…

214
00:12:54,64 --> 00:12:57,20
...a date-type thing...
瑞秋的約會對像…

215
00:12:57,84 --> 00:12:58,70
...of Rachel's.
…朋友

216
00:12:59,71 --> 00:13:01,00
A date?
約會？

217
00:13:01,61 --> 00:13:02,80
I'm her date.
對，她的約會對像

218
00:13:03,01 --> 00:13:04,81
Oh! Oh,you're a....
你是…你是…

219
00:13:05,01 --> 00:13:07,61
Oh,you're the date.
她約會的對象

220
00:13:08,05 --> 00:13:09,35
This is actually good...
其實這也滿好玩的…

221
00:13:09,55 --> 00:13:12,21
... because if we lose Ross, we have a spare.
因為萬一我們失去了羅斯 還有一個備用的

222
00:13:13,19 --> 00:13:15,71
Oh! You are the paleontologist.
你是那個…古生物學家

223
00:13:16,29 --> 00:13:19,35
Yes. Yes,I am. And you are a....
對，我是 那你是…

224
00:13:21,40 --> 00:13:22,23
Periodontist.
牙科醫師

225
00:13:22,56 --> 00:13:25,56
See? Now they're as different as night and...
瞧，現在他們簡直是黑夜跟…

226
00:13:26,40 --> 00:13:27,89
...Iater that night.
…更黑的夜

227
00:13:28,47 --> 00:13:32,10
Well,I am going to get a beverage.
我現在要去…拿杯飲料

228
00:13:32,31 --> 00:13:34,37
It was nice meeting you.
很高興…很高興認識你

229
00:13:34,58 --> 00:13:35,56
Ditto.
彼此

230
00:13:41,92 --> 00:13:43,25
Well,I met Russ.
我…我見過洛斯了

231
00:13:45,99 --> 00:13:48,75
Hey,I didn't know we were seeing other people.
我不知道我們…邊跟別人交往

232
00:13:49,22 --> 00:13:52,19
Well,we're not seeing each other,so....
我們又沒有在交往，所以…

233
00:13:52,99 --> 00:13:55,89
For your information, there's a woman at the museum...
我告訴你好了 我們館裡有個女的…

234
00:13:56,10 --> 00:13:59,07
...who's curator of moths and other...
…負責蛾類…

235
00:14:00,37 --> 00:14:01,23
...winged things...
…跟其他有翅生物…

236
00:14:03,57 --> 00:14:07,67
...who's let it be known that she is drawn to me,much like a...
…她明顯地表示她喜歡我 就像是…

237
00:14:07,88 --> 00:14:08,71
...you know.
你知道嘛

238
00:14:10,28 --> 00:14:13,11
I've kept her at bay, but if this is the deal
我到現在還跟她保持距離 但是如果你要這樣的話…

239
00:14:13,35 --> 00:14:14,58
This is the deal.
對，我要這樣

240
00:14:14,78 --> 00:14:16,77
Okay,well,have a nice evening.
那好，祝你有愉快的一晚

241
00:14:17,69 --> 00:14:19,02
Russ,you ready?
洛斯，你好了嗎？

242
00:14:26,26 --> 00:14:27,73
She's dating?
她在約會？

243
00:14:28,40 --> 00:14:29,42
She's dating?
她在約會？

244
00:14:29,63 --> 00:14:32,72
Yes,but did you see who she was dating?
