你看不出來嗎？ 看什麼？

247
00:14:37,04 --> 00:14:39,80
I don't know what she sees in that goober!
我真搞不懂 她看中那驢蛋哪一點

248
00:14:42,64 --> 00:14:45,70
It takes him,what? Like,I don't know...
那…那個傢伙…

249
00:14:45,95 --> 00:14:48,38
... hello,a week to get out a sentence?
…講完一句話要等一個禮拜

250
00:14:49,55 --> 00:14:50,92
It's annoying,isn't it?
是呀，煩死人了，是不是？

251
00:15:07,17 --> 00:15:08,90
You didn't get the part...
我猜你沒有得到那個角色…

252
00:15:09,10 --> 00:15:11,50
...or ltaly called and said it was hungry?
…或是意大利來電說它餓了

253
00:15:12,34 --> 00:15:14,24
The part's mine if I want it.
不，我要的話那角色就是我的

254
00:15:14,88 --> 00:15:15,77
Oh,my God!
老天啊

255
00:15:16,04 --> 00:15:18,74
If I'm willing to sleep with the casting lady.
對呀，只要我願意 跟選角小姐上床的話

256
00:15:19,01 --> 00:15:20,17
Oh,my...
我的…

257
00:15:20,38 --> 00:15:21,54
...God?
老天啊？

258
00:15:22,75 --> 00:15:26,52
Ten years I've been waiting for a break like this. Ten years!
我等了十年 才等到這個機會，錢德

259
00:15:26,75 --> 00:15:30,42
I mean,Days of our Lives. That's actually on television!
我是說「我們的日子」 那真的會在電視上播出

260
00:15:31,36 --> 00:15:32,79
What are you gonna do?
那你要怎麼做？

261
00:15:33,03 --> 00:15:35,46
I guess I could sleep with her. I mean....
我可以跟她上床…

262
00:15:35,73 --> 00:15:37,09
How can I do that?
但我怎麼能那麼做呢

263
00:15:37,36 --> 00:15:41,13
I've got a pop-up book that told me everything I need to know.
我有一本 教我關於性的一切的立體書

264
00:15:41,97 --> 00:15:44,10
I've never slept with someone for a part.
我從沒有為了角色 跟人家上床過

265
00:15:44,31 --> 00:15:45,47
Well,is she
那麼她是…

266
00:15:47,81 --> 00:15:48,78
Sorry.
抱歉

267
00:15:50,24 --> 00:15:51,94
Is she good-looking?
她長得好看嗎？

268
00:15:52,21 --> 00:15:55,44
She's totally good-looking. If I met her in a bar...
好看，她長得非常的好看 若我在酒吧認識她的話…

269
00:15:55,72 --> 00:15:57,98
... I'd be buying her breakfast.
…我一定會請她吃早餐

270
00:15:59,89 --> 00:16:01,72
After having slept with her.
你知道，我是說跟她上床之後

271
00:16:07,39 --> 00:16:09,56
Maybe this isn't such a big deal.
喬伊，或許這沒什麼大不了的

272
00:16:09,76 --> 00:16:14,67
The way that I see it is,you get a great job,and you get to have sex!
依我看你不但得到一份好工作 還可以跟她上床

273
00:16:15,47 --> 00:16:18,46
Throw in a tree and a fat guy, and you've got Christmas!
也許再加上一棵樹跟胖子 就像聖誕樹了

274
00:16:22,84 --> 00:16:26,14
I just don't think that I want it that way,though.
我只是不希望 那樣得到這份工作

275
00:16:26,35 --> 00:16:28,82
I mean,let's say I do make it,all right?
就說有一天萬一我成名好了

276
00:16:29,08 --> 00:16:33,25
I'll always look back and wonder if it was because of my talent or...
我會懷疑那到底是因為 我的才華，還是因為我的…

277
00:16:33,49 --> 00:16:35,32
...you know,the little general.
…你知道，我的小將軍

278
00:16:38,03 --> 00:16:40,96
Didn't you used to call it "the little major"?
你以前不是叫它 「小少校」的嗎？

279
00:16:41,20 --> 00:16:43,66
After Denise DeMarco, I had to promote it.
對呀，但是在上過狄丹妮後 它就升級了

280
00:16:49,64 --> 00:16:51,16
Something from the bar?
兩位要不要來一杯酒啊？

281
00:16:51,37 --> 00:16:53,14
Yes,I would like something.
好，我要點杯酒

282
00:16:54,17 --> 00:16:56,23
No. No,thank you.
不，不，謝謝

283
00:16:56,44 --> 00:17:00,17
If you wanna drink,it's okay with me. I've gotta get used to it.
沒關係，你想喝酒的話 我沒問題，我要習慣這種事

284
00:17:00,38 --> 00:17:03,15
No,no,really. I wouldn't feel right about it.
不…真的 我冰箱裡面的燈熄了

285
00:17:03,52 --> 00:17:04,88
Just some water,please.
來杯水好了

286
00:17:05,62 --> 00:17:09,15
-So my refrigerator light's out. -Scotch on the rocks with a twist!
我會覺得很不舒服 來杯威士忌加冰塊跟檸檬

287
00:17:12,16 --> 00:17:14,49
We're having some fun now,huh,Ross?
這個遊戲很有趣吧，羅斯？

288
00:17:14,80 --> 00:17:17,06
Wanna do another one? Huh,Russ?
我們再做一個好不好，洛斯？

289
00:17:20,13 --> 00:17:21,40
Eleven letters...
十一個字母

290
