...atomic element number 101, ends in "ium."
它的原子序號碼是101 字尾是「IUM」

291
00:17:25,81 --> 00:17:26,74
Dysprosium.
是鏑

292
00:17:27,47 --> 00:17:28,81
Dysprosium.
什麼是鎬？

293
00:17:29,04 --> 00:17:30,51
Try mendelevium.
我看試試鍆吧

294
00:17:30,84 --> 00:17:32,97
And weenie number two has it.
二號參賽者答對了

295
00:17:33,75 --> 00:17:37,55
Unless "Knights in White Satin" was sung by the Doody Blues.
除非直九的「白緞之夜」 是「杜迪藍調」唱的

296
00:17:41,52 --> 00:17:44,05
You don't see it? You actually don't see it?
你真的看不出來嗎？

297
00:17:44,26 --> 00:17:45,16
What?
什麼？

298
00:17:45,66 --> 00:17:47,49
Honey,you're dating Ross.
你在跟羅斯約會

299
