No,Pheebs,I'm dating Russ.
不，菲菲，我跟洛斯約會

300
00:17:49,60 --> 00:17:52,06
Russ is Ross. Russ,Ross.
洛斯就是羅斯，洛斯，羅斯

301
00:17:52,27 --> 00:17:53,67
Steve,sleeve.
史提，史裡

302
00:17:54,60 --> 00:17:56,36
No one is named sleeve.
沒有人叫那種名字

303
00:17:57,20 --> 00:17:59,10
What are you talking about?
菲比，你到底在鬼扯什麼？

304
00:17:59,34 --> 00:18:03,40
Other than their names being similar, I do not see what you're seeing.
除了名字相似之外 對不起，我看不到你看到的

305
00:18:03,61 --> 00:18:05,27
For your information...
我老實告訴你好了…

306
00:18:05,51 --> 00:18:07,78
...it's a card sharp, not a card shark.
…是賭勝 不是賭聖

307
00:18:08,02 --> 00:18:09,57
You could not be more wrong.
你錯得不可能再錯

308
00:18:09,85 --> 00:18:12,34
You could try, but you would not be successful.
你可以試，可是你不會成功

309
00:18:13,25 --> 00:18:17,52
I'm gonna get some more coffee before the pinching and eye-poking begins.
我先倒杯咖啡 然後再回來看你們互戳眼睛

310
00:18:19,43 --> 00:18:20,62
I know your problem.
我知道問題在哪兒了

311
00:18:20,89 --> 00:18:22,09
Oh,you do,do you?
是嗎？

312
00:18:22,80 --> 00:18:23,63
You're jealous.
你嫉妒

313
00:18:26,43 --> 00:18:27,90
Of what?
嫉妒什麼？

314
00:18:28,20 --> 00:18:30,60
You're jealous because I'm a real doctor.
你嫉妒我是個真正的醫生

315
00:18:32,64 --> 00:18:34,44
Hey,you're a doctor of gums.
你是牙齦的醫生

316
00:18:34,64 --> 00:18:37,13
That's the smallest body part you can major in.
那是人能夠鑽研的 最小的人體器官

317
00:18:38,98 --> 00:18:41,54
Day one,floss. Day two,here's your diploma.
就像是第一天教你用牙線 第二天，這是你的文憑

318
00:18:41,75 --> 00:18:42,81
You listen here
你給我聽著…

319
00:18:43,05 --> 00:18:44,88
-Let me finish. -No,let me finish.
不，讓我說完 不，你讓我說完

320
00:18:45,09 --> 00:18:47,05
No,you let me fin
不，你讓我說完…

321
00:19:00,73 --> 00:19:02,93
Did Joey say what he was gonna do?
喬伊走時有沒有說打算怎麼做

322
00:19:03,57 --> 00:19:05,00
I don't even think he knew.
沒有，我想他自己也不知道

323
00:19:05,24 --> 00:19:07,80
Would you sleep with somebody to get a great job?
你會為一個很棒的工作 跟別人上床嗎？

324
00:19:08,18 --> 00:19:10,51
Who would I have to sleep with?
我必須跟誰上床？

325
00:19:10,74 --> 00:19:11,80
Me.
我

326
00:19:14,48 --> 00:19:16,11
Why with you?
我幹嘛得跟你上床？

327
00:19:16,32 --> 00:19:18,58
It's my game. You want the job or not?
這是我的事 這工作你到底要不要？

328
00:19:22,26 --> 00:19:23,15
Good morning.
早

329
00:19:23,42 --> 00:19:24,52
Where you going?
你去哪裡？

330
00:19:24,76 --> 00:19:27,75
Bobby and I are going away for the weekend. Remember?
我要跟巴比去小木屋度週末 記得嗎？

331
00:19:29,10 --> 00:19:30,69
What's with all the liquor?
帶那麼多酒幹什麼？

332
00:19:30,96 --> 00:19:33,36
What's going on? Is Bobby drinking again?
怎麼了？巴比又開始喝酒了

333
00:19:33,67 --> 00:19:36,03
This is not for him. This is for me.
不…這不是他喝的 這是給我的

334
00:19:37,50 --> 00:19:41,17
That way,he's sober but his shoelace stories are more amusing.
這樣他會很清醒，而我會覺得 他的鞋帶笑話好笑多了

335
00:19:46,55 --> 00:19:49,14
God! Even his knock is boring!
天哪，他連敲門 怎麼都這麼乏味啊

336
00:19:51,82 --> 00:19:55,02
-I'll be ready in a second. -Could I talk to you?
我馬上就好了 我可以跟你談一談嗎？

337
00:19:55,22 --> 00:19:56,05
Sure.
可以啊

338
00:19:58,03 --> 00:19:59,69
This is hard for me to say.
這真的很難開口

339
00:19:59,96 --> 00:20:01,69
You fell off the wagon!
天啊，你又開始喝酒了

340
00:20:01,90 --> 00:20:03,06
Oh,no,no.
不是…

341
00:20:03,63 --> 00:20:04,49
It's about you.
是關於你的

342
00:20:05,13 --> 00:20:06,22
What about me?
我怎麼了？

343
00:20:06,80 --> 00:20:09,03
I think you may have a drinking problem.
我想你或許有酗酒問題

344
00:20:12,41 --> 00:20:13,63
What,these?
不，這些是…

345
00:20:14,54 --> 00:20:17,17
No,these are for cuts and scrapes.
…擦傷口用的

346
00:20:18,48 --> 00:20:22,54
Look,I'm not strong enough to be in a codependent relationship.
我現在無法扯入一段 相互依賴的關係當中

347
00:20:23,92 --> 00:20:25,32
Oh,shoot.
該死

348
00:20:28,06 --> 00:20:30,99
Well,anyway, I hope we can be friends.
不管怎麼樣 我希望我們還是朋友

349
00:20:35,53 --> 00:20:36,39
Take care.
保重了

350
00:20:36,60 --> 00:20:39,07
-You too. -Goodbye.
你也是 拜

351
00:20:42,54 --> 00:20:43,66
What happened?
怎麼了？

352
00:20:45,77 --> 00:20:46,90
We kind of broke up.
我們分手了

353
00:20:54,11 --> 00:20:55,58
Does anybody want these?
這些酒誰要？

354
00:20:55,85 --> 00:20:57,04
I'll take one.
我拿一瓶

355
00:20:58,05 --> 00:21:01,51
Sometimes I hold stuff like this and pretend I'm a giant.
我有時候喜歡拿這種東西 假裝我是個巨人

356
00:21:07,13 --> 00:21:08,79
How'd the callback go?
複試結果怎麼樣？

357
00:21:09,03 --> 00:21:12,76
It was unbelievable. I walked in there and she was all over me.
簡直不可思議，我一進去 她就開始對我上下其手

358
00:21:12,97 --> 00:21:15,06
-What did you do? -I couldn't do it.
結果呢？ 我就是辦不到

359
00:21:15,27 --> 00:21:17,13
I didn't want the part that way.
我告訴她我不想那樣得到角色

360
00:21:17,37 --> 00:21:18,20
Good for you!
幹得好…

361
00:21:18,41 --> 00:21:19,96
But wait! I left her office...
等等，我離開她辦公室之後 她追我追到電梯來

362
00:21:20,21 --> 00:21:24,30
...and she caught up with me and offered me a bigger part.
她說要給我一個更重要的角色

363
00:21:24,71 --> 00:21:25,64
So,and?
所以呢？

364
00:21:27,31 --> 00:21:31,81
So,you are now looking at Dr. Drake Ramoray,neurosurgeon...
所以… 各位面前站的是雷醫生…

365
00:21:32,05 --> 00:21:34,61
... recurring in at least four episodes!
…是一位至少會在四集裡面 出鏡的神經外科醫師

366
00:21:35,89 --> 00:21:37,72
All right,I gotta go shower.
太棒了…我去洗澡了

367
00:21:53,94 --> 00:21:56,37
I guess you guys heard Rachel dumped me.
你們聽說我被瑞秋甩了吧？

368
00:21:56,61 --> 00:21:58,04
Yeah,I'm sorry,man.
是呀，很遺憾啊，老兄

369
00:21:58,75 --> 00:22:01,04
She said I remind her too much of somebody.
她說我會讓她想起另外一個人

370
00:22:01,25 --> 00:22:03,08
Any idea who she's talking about?
你們知道那個人是誰嗎？

371
00:22:05,02 --> 00:22:07,68
Oh,I do. It's Bob Saget.
我知道，是…沙巴西格

372
00:22:09,62 --> 00:22:11,18
She hates him.
她恨他

373
00:22:12,79 --> 00:22:13,92
Hey,Julie!
茱莉

374
00:22:14,23 --> 00:22:15,75
How are you doing?
最近好嗎？

375
00:22:15,96 --> 00:22:19,13
I don't know. It's weird not being with Ross...
我不知道 沒有了羅斯，的確很不對勁…

376
00:22:19,37 --> 00:22:21,46
... but I guess I'm doing okay.
…但是我猜我還好啦

377
00:22:21,74 --> 00:22:24,53
Actually,I've got some of his stuff that he....
事實上 我帶了一些他的東西…

378
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


379
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


